  m_Name: Hild
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::ResidentDefinition
  id: settler.hild
  displayName: Hild
  description: A mason who followed the smoke. She has opinions about your footings.
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: de06220de1b83e44ca9b6909382d71c8, type: 3}
  rescueLine: Mind the coping. It's the only level thing for a mile.
  arrivalLine: Whoever laid this hearth had never met a level. I'll stay.
  welcomeLine: Your hearth isn't level, your footings are soft and your walls are wood. Who cut these blocks? Not bad. I'll cut them from now on.
  fallenLine: I can't go on... come back for me.
  fightLines:
    spotted: []
    behindYou: []
    hurt: []
    won: []
    helpedUp: []
